Print off the printable handout for a checklist-type list of activities that can be used as a home program for[ therapists]. School-based OT[s] will love to add these checklists to their tool[box] of[ resources] that can be shared with teachers and parents. It's a great[ explanation sheet] for helping parents and teachers understand the[ underlying] skill[ areas] that go into[ handwriting] and[ pencil] grasp.
This printable handout is a tool you need in your[ therapy] binder to copy and share again and again!
